---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Why Daryva exists: rent and deposit tracking that's actually correct, built by someone who cared more about getting the numbers right than shipping fast."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <span class="eyebrow">Why Daryva exists</span>
      <h1>Most property software gets the money roughly right. We wanted it exactly right.</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="prose-section">
    <div class="container-narrow prose">
      <p>
        Daryva started as a tool for tracking a handful of properties properly — because
        spreadsheets and half-finished apps have a habit of getting rent and deposits <em>almost</em>
        right, which is a different thing from right. A deposit quietly reused as rent every
        month while still showing as fully refundable. A voided payment that just disappears
        instead of leaving a trail. A tenancy record that only tells half the story.
      </p>
      <p>
        None of that is acceptable when it's someone's money. So Daryva is built the way you'd
        want a ledger built: every figure traceable, every correction kept rather than erased,
        and every calculation checked against what actually happened — not what should have
        happened if nobody made a mistake.
      </p>
      <p>
        It's for landlords managing their own properties and for letting agents managing several
        portfolios at once — anyone who'd rather trust their numbers than double-check them by
        hand at the end of every month.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta">
    <div class="container-narrow cta-inner">
      <h2>Have properties you'd like to move over?</h2>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Get in touch</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    padding-top: 72px;
    padding-bottom: 56px;
  }

  .page-hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 42px);
    margin: 18px 0 0;
    max-width: 20ch;
  }

  .prose-section {
    padding-top: 8px;
  }

  .prose {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    padding-top: 48px;
  }

  .prose p {
    max-width: none;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .prose p + p {
    margin-top: 22px;
  }

  .prose em {
    color: var(--accent-bright);
    font-style: italic;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
  }

  .cta-inner {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .cta-inner h2 {
    font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 30px);
    margin-bottom: 26px;
  }
</style>
